---
# `role-name` rejects a hyphen in a role directory name (`^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$`). The
# hyphenated roles here (claude-code, agent-reach, multica-cli, playwright-cli and the rest)
# match the upstream tool each installs and appear in main.yml, every meta/main.yml,
# AGENTS.md and docs/, so the rule is skipped rather than obeyed. Every other rule stays on:
# the point is that `ansible-lint` exits 0 on a clean tree, so a NEW finding is visible
# instead of being lost among pre-existing ones.
skip_list:
  - role-name
